g the  return to Shingo chena arc the Warriors  probably would have won but he didn't  use it immediately because he was  worried about Reiner getting caught up  in the explosion besides this amazing  ability that could take out the other  Titans except for the armored Titan  whose unique armor allows it to  withstand the explosion the colossal  Titan can also control steam in a way no  other Titan can the colossal Titan can  release large amounts of steam from its  body which can repel and/or burn  anything that comes near it  this ability almost killed armand by  burning him to a crisp and blew many  other surrey corps members away such an  ability could act as a possible defense  against long-range weapons like the  beasts titans rocks and the Warhammer  Titans arrows although they probably  wouldn't do much damage even if they did  hit the colossal Titan the only possible  hope that the Warhammer Titan could have  in order to defeat the colossal Titan is  if it managed to avoid its initial  explosion it's burning steam and managed  to somehow create spikes large enough to  effectively impale the colossal Titan  however we've never seen it create  spikes that large while the colossal  Titans other powerful abilities have to  put it above the Warhammer Titan on this  list number one the founding Titan  lastly at number one we have the  founding tighten to tighten that rod  Reese called the greatest of all Titans  Rodri explains that it possesses an  invincible power but Frieda Reese  managed to lose it to Grisha  because she lacked the experience  necessary to exploit its full potential  and Sol was unable to unleash its true  abilities however in this list we are  examining hypothetical Titan shifters  who are able to fully use their titans  abilities so let's look at what a  founding Titan should be able to do just  as the colossal Titan has been called  the god destruction the Titan has been  called God because of its amazing powers  to begin what the founding 